       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-FORMAL-REVIEW-PHASE5-STRATEGY.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-PHASE5-GRAND-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-PHASES-1-TO-4-PASSED PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-RULE-18-UNBROKEN         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-MOTZKIN-GALOIS-IMMUTABLE PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTIENT-ZERO-CONVERGED   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-GRAND-SOVEREIGN-SEALED   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-FINAL-CERTIFICATE.
           05  WS-FORMAL-REVIEW-COMPLETE   PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-GRAND-CODE         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-AUDIT-ALL-PHASE-GATES.
           PERFORM 2000-AUDIT-MATHEMATICAL-BEDROCK.
           PERFORM 3000-ISSUE-FINAL-CERTIFICATE.
           GOBACK.
       1000-AUDIT-ALL-PHASE-GATES.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-PHASES-1-TO-4-PASSED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-RULE-18-UNBROKEN.
       2000-AUDIT-MATHEMATICAL-BEDROCK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MOTZKIN-GALOIS-IMMUTABLE.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTIENT-ZERO-CONVERGED.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-GRAND-SOVEREIGN-SEALED.
       3000-ISSUE-FINAL-CERTIFICATE.
           IF WS-ALL-PHASES-1-TO-4-PASSED = 1 AND
              WS-RULE-18-UNBROKEN = 1 AND
              WS-MOTZKIN-GALOIS-IMMUTABLE = 1 AND
              WS-TOTIENT-ZERO-CONVERGED = 1 AND
              WS-GRAND-SOVEREIGN-SEALED = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-FORMAL-REVIEW-COMPLETE
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAND-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-FORMAL-REVIEW-COMPLETE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-GRAND-CODE.
